                <invention-title lang="de">SCHNITTSTELLE FÜR MEHRERE GLEICHZEITIGE INTERAKTIVE ANSICHTEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">INTERFACE POUR DE MULTIPLES VUES INTERACTIVES SIMULTANÉES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">INTERFACE FOR MULTIPLE SIMULTANEOUS INTERACTIVE VIEWS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method comprises displaying content for a first web page in a first pane on a mobile device whilst the first pane being displayed is in a maximized state on the mobile device. A touch input on a navigation control associated with the first pane is received. Responsive to receiving the touch input, a second web page is displayed in a second pane on the mobile device, the second pane being in a minimized state in a dock area, the dock area overlaying the first pane in the maximized state. The minimized state of the second pane displays a smaller version of the second web page in the second pane, in a maximized state. The dock area is calculated from a minimum screen coordinate and a dimension of a pane in the minimized state, the dimension being a dimension perpendicular to a scroll direction of the dock area.</p>
            </abstract>
